{
    "word": "rapprochement",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7579a3a4-8b6e-31c9-9e29-8d8f99ae761d",
                "word": "rapprochement",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "fe05d97c-3139-4469-b660-028742940a54",
                        "entry_id": "7579a3a4-8b6e-31c9-9e29-8d8f99ae761d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "rapprochements"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1ccda2fd-b890-355c-886b-2d8e229c12c9",
                        "entry_id": "7579a3a4-8b6e-31c9-9e29-8d8f99ae761d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The reestablishment of cordial relations, particularly between two countries; a reconciliation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2eec3de-3869-44fd-860d-927d98a7566a",
                                "sense_id": "1ccda2fd-b890-355c-886b-2d8e229c12c9",
                                "text": "It was the Nixon administration that saw the rapprochement between the United States and China."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1a01540-962b-4b1b-bb5c-17862437af35",
                                "sense_id": "1ccda2fd-b890-355c-886b-2d8e229c12c9",
                                "text": "The inauguration of a liberal order of things, a rapprochement of the [First French] Empire with constitutionalism and Parliamentary government, had been expected from the Speech from the Throne now just given. This expectation is completely disappointed by the speech. …"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80c9f1a5-1c40-4677-9d9e-3e51777ab954",
                                "sense_id": "1ccda2fd-b890-355c-886b-2d8e229c12c9",
                                "text": "Not forever, however, was the animal world to suffer this indignity at the hands of man. Thinkers themselves prepared the way for a rapprochement between the two. More particularly the English philosophers from [John] Locke onward, together with their French followers, […] may be said by a sort of leveling-down process to have favored the idea of a mental kinship between man and brute."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "51910c17-ec61-47c4-a83c-42b244dc610e",
                                "sense_id": "1ccda2fd-b890-355c-886b-2d8e229c12c9",
                                "text": "M. [Aristide] Briand, in a statement on the French foreign policy said a lasting European peace was impossible without a Franco-German rapprochement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bbd7b92d-cfef-4588-a372-e149e7c495c4",
                                "sense_id": "1ccda2fd-b890-355c-886b-2d8e229c12c9",
                                "text": "Attempts at a Hungarian–Yugoslavian rapprochement are not a recent matter, and Italy has always approved of them. But in the past these attempts had been made with the idea of breaking up the Little Entente and isolating Yugoslavia."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d39f49c-c426-45d0-8a6a-290b92f5e20e",
                                "sense_id": "1ccda2fd-b890-355c-886b-2d8e229c12c9",
                                "text": "Further, I argue that [Robin George] Collingwood's final work is in fact the culmination of his persistent endeavour to bring about rapprochements between philosophy and history, and between theory and practice."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2befda4b-cbfc-4ddd-ac38-fba5ae1b84cc",
                                "sense_id": "1ccda2fd-b890-355c-886b-2d8e229c12c9",
                                "text": "“These norms were laid in the early 2000s, when Seoul’s so-called sunshine policy took off,” Sung-Yoon Lee, a Korea expert at Tufts University, told The Washington Post last week, referring to a rapprochement policy adopted by South Korea."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d079ff1-4282-48ae-964d-17c7074fea33",
                                "sense_id": "1ccda2fd-b890-355c-886b-2d8e229c12c9",
                                "text": "The fighting[…] threatens to upend recent efforts to de-escalate tensions across the wider Middle East, whose rival powers, including Iran and Saudi Arabia, have made steps toward rapprochement in recent days after years of turmoil."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5813101-6af7-4a2a-bb4b-275143deec19",
                                "sense_id": "1ccda2fd-b890-355c-886b-2d8e229c12c9",
                                "text": "Critics, including many veterans of the diplomatic corps, have been alarmed by Mr. Trump’s apparent rapprochement with Russia."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fbef413e-ddd7-45f1-a75c-7fac9d340770",
                        "source_entry_id": "7579a3a4-8b6e-31c9-9e29-8d8f99ae761d",
                        "source_sense_id": "1ccda2fd-b890-355c-886b-2d8e229c12c9",
                        "source_sense_description": "reestablishment of cordial relations",
                        "target_lang_word": "rapprochement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rapprochement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e0ededf-f7e4-3a0b-a3d2-c69ef7cae469",
                                        "entry_id": "366bbeb6-00cd-3fa6-ad1d-45b7e4b641d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de rapprocher des objets ou des personnes ; résultat de cette action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literally"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "867b8036-a6d7-4580-b90a-7a51c5cd266e",
                                                "sense_id": "3e0ededf-f7e4-3a0b-a3d2-c69ef7cae469",
                                                "text": "À partir de 1964 cependant, sous l’influence de deux pouvoirs politiques consolidés, le rapprochement va s’imposer comme un impératif majeur […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77d53209-d9e2-446b-9d63-54009527fda5",
                                                "sense_id": "3e0ededf-f7e4-3a0b-a3d2-c69ef7cae469",
                                                "text": "Fulk Ephrinell s’entretient avec miss Horatia Bluett, et je comprends qu’il y ait eu rapprochement entre ces deux natures si parfaitement anglo-saxonnes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6d8d56c-ce37-3acb-9a64-bb84f46f46ef",
                                        "entry_id": "366bbeb6-00cd-3fa6-ad1d-45b7e4b641d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Accommodement entre parties adverses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68d6b228-ba72-41fc-9c79-d19e471dde4b",
                                                "sense_id": "a6d8d56c-ce37-3acb-9a64-bb84f46f46ef",
                                                "text": "[…] on comprenait peu le rapprochement de deux partis aussi haineux que l’étaient à cette heure le parti protestant et le parti catholique : […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4974e884-dac5-4d71-ad29-c8d61dbda1c2",
                                                "sense_id": "a6d8d56c-ce37-3acb-9a64-bb84f46f46ef",
                                                "text": "Que reste-t-il donc aujourd'hui de leur héritage, que reste-t-il donc du nassérisme et du baasisme, après le drame de leurs fondateurs, après leur tumultueux rapprochement et leur douloureuse séparation ? A la vérité, presque rien et presque tout."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c2fab1ac-0a39-3c76-bf4c-48d2a25b15c4",
                                        "entry_id": "366bbeb6-00cd-3fa6-ad1d-45b7e4b641d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Réunion d’idées ou de faits, de manière qu’ils s’éclairent l’un par l’autre, ou qu’on en fasse plus aisément la comparaison."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e07ecb41-7321-48af-a4c6-9c8790dbf320",
                                                "sense_id": "c2fab1ac-0a39-3c76-bf4c-48d2a25b15c4",
                                                "text": "Ce premier mémoire est terminé par des rapprochements très-ingénieux , qui résultent de la comparaison de la plombagine, de l’anthracite, du charbon et du diamant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ddcd4862-7949-41cd-8518-211d1dd07f06",
                                                "sense_id": "c2fab1ac-0a39-3c76-bf4c-48d2a25b15c4",
                                                "text": "Mais on n’en finira pas, en revanche, de « comparer » : comparer est inexhaustible. On n’en finira pas d'enfiler les recoupements, d’aller chercher plus loin, ailleurs, des rapprochements."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ddd84d9-60b5-492d-b462-3fe9a02178ed",
                                                "sense_id": "c2fab1ac-0a39-3c76-bf4c-48d2a25b15c4",
                                                "text": "Il n'y a pas très longtemps que j'ai fait le rapprochement entre ces gribouillis et les histoires de Tintin qui, quinze ans après, allaient voir le jour"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9f0df0e-2a4c-383d-8ae3-698b2a52b86a",
                                        "entry_id": "366bbeb6-00cd-3fa6-ad1d-45b7e4b641d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Résultat de cette action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94d7dae8-cca3-427b-868b-ef3b02d8b6f4",
                                                "sense_id": "b9f0df0e-2a4c-383d-8ae3-698b2a52b86a",
                                                "text": "Le Tableau historique des Nations offre donc le rapprochement des événements les plus mémorables arrivés dans le même temps sur toute la surface de la terre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "086db49a-4d08-452b-bbd5-c5af9e3448cf",
                                                "sense_id": "b9f0df0e-2a4c-383d-8ae3-698b2a52b86a",
                                                "text": "Lorsqu’elle établit le diagnostic d’hypertension artérielle pulmonaire chez une de ses patientes obèses dont l’anamnèse révèle qu'elle est traitée par le Médiator, son expérience et sa perspicacité l’amène à faire des rapprochements."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
